---
<section class="py-12 px-4 md:px-8 border-t border-slate-100">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12">
    
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <h3 class="font-bold text-blue-900 uppercase text-sm tracking-widest">Administrative Records</h3>
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
        Governing documents, conflict of interest policy, and financial statements are available upon request to:
      </p>
      <div class="text-slate-800 text-sm font-medium">
        <p class="font-bold">Dawn Rich Meitrott, Executive Director</p>
        <p>Another Step, Inc.</p>
        <p>30 Ramland Road, Suite 202</p>
        <p>Orangeburg, NY 10962</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-blue-900 text-white p-8 rounded-3xl flex flex-col justify-center">
      <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">Charity Information</h3>
      <p class="text-blue-100 text-sm mb-4">
        You can obtain more information about charities by calling the Attorney General:
      </p>
      <a href="tel:2124168686" class="text-2xl font-bold text-yellow-400 hover:text-yellow-300 transition-colors">
        212-416-8686
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>